ity":null,"_gate_margins":null,"_gp_margins":null,"_score_margins":null,"_gate_fund_growth":null,"_gp_fund_growth":null,"_score_fund_growth":null,"_gate_shrhldr_yield":-6.768049588391835e-05,"_gp_shrhldr_yield":false,"_score_shrhldr_yield":11.0,"_gate_share_shrink":0.24435343093511208,"_gp_share_shrink":false,"_score_share_shrink":0.0,"_gate_sbc_dilution":null,"_gp_sbc_dilution":null,"_score_sbc_dilution":0.0,"_gate_insider_own":0.02389,"_gp_insider_own":false,"_score_insider_own":15.9,"_gate_insider_buying":null,"_gp_insider_buying":null,"_score_insider_buying":null,"pf":[],"description_full":"FDCTech, Inc. operates as a technology provider and software developer for digital assets. The company operates through four segments: Margin Brokerage, Payment Intermediary Services, Technology and Software Development; and Wealth Management. The company's Margin Brokerage segment offers multi-asset trading services in forex, CFDs, equities, commodities, and digital assets to retail and institutional clients. Its Wealth Management segment provides licensing solutions and financial planning services to these financial advisors. The Technology and Software Development segment develops and licenses proprietary Condor Trading Technology suite, including the Condor Pro Multi-Asset Trading Platform and Condor Risk Management back-office system. Its Payment Intermediary Services segment in involved in developing payment gateway, merchant acquiring, and cross-border payment capabilities to complement brokerage and wealth management operations. The company provides multi-asset trading services in forex, CFDs, equities, commodities, and digital assets; and spot forex, precious metals, spread bets, and contracts for difference on currencies, commodities, indices, individual equities, cryptocurrencies, bonds, and interest rate products, as well as OTC options. The company was formerly known as Forex Development Corporation and changed its name to FDCTech, Inc. in February 2018. FDCTech, Inc. was incorporated in 2016 and is based in Limassol, Cyprus.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Mitchell M. Eaglstein | Co-Founder, President, CEO & Acting Chairman of the Board | Age 43 | Compensation: $180,000 (FY2025)","financial_summary":["FDCTech, Inc. is a small-cap financial services business with a $520M market cap on $35M of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +76% over the past three years, the kind of sustained demand persistence that marks a compounder.","Returns on capital run at -62% against a 10% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests, with gross margins sitting at 47%.","The company is burning through $41M of cash, and without positive owner earnings any valuation rests on hope rather than evidence.","Accruals are elevated at +73.3% of assets, and Sloan showed firms building earnings through accruals rather than cash systematically underperform.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year.","Net dilution runs at 0.0% annually, transferring value from owners to stock-based comp, and insiders hold 2.4% of the shares."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Accruals elevated at +73.3% of assets \u2014 Sloan showed firms building earnings through accruals rather than cash systematically underperform","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Beneish M-Score flags potential earnings manipulation \u2014 a question of whether the reported numbers can be trusted","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"ROIC sits in the bottom decile among Financial Services peers \u2014 no moat advantage to speak of","sev":"red","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Operating margins 12% below sector median \u2014 a cost disadvantage the moat cannot hide","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Carries a 132% premium to sector median EV/EBITDA","sev":"amber","cat":"valuation","magnitude":1.315421663990934},{"text":"Piotroski score 4/9 \u2014 below the median for a healthy business","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Credit cycles and regulatory capital \u2014 losses accumulate invisibly in good years and appear all at once, and the time to worry is when underwriting standards are loosest.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Fintech disintermediation \u2014 neobanks, embedded finance, and blockchain rails are unbundling the fee streams that traditional banks took for granted.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Altman Z comfortably in the safe zone \u2014 a fortress balance sheet on this measure","Founder-led \u2014 owner alignment that often matters more than any incentive plan","Growing faster than most Financial Services peers \u2014 taking share inside the profit pool"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Revenue rose 108% over nine months, but FDCTech (FDCT) swung to a loss in Q3. - Stock Titan","source":"Stock Titan","link":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxOR0hpNDlfX1Nob00zQ1d2ZlB2WFRJU2FKMTUwMTdHdDRlanFiNS1VUzBWbVBud0ZhUENIZ1htajJncEpwOUlteTJybzlVS1NrYnlDLTZ1aE84NWJTaU5oM1hBcWZROUoxaEljMDVjMHhPd3RZcjdzbEc2SkxkY1JiM3hYMjZucXhabC03X0k3enNBXzJoOFNGRGM4OGk5bURqNUpmYjBTZw?oc=5","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794605584.0,"origin":"google_news_ticker","tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"FDCTech, Inc. (FDCT) stock price, news, quote and history - Yahoo Finance UK","source":"Yahoo Finance UK","link":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTE9SUUhqbzVDRElfMjNiQ2lmWkMtN0RqOEE4NFdXSmpNSm95UEtNU0RFcXV0LXFKVHVrLTQyMzFwcWRfX3FVeVZvT3ljcTd5V0NuYUE?oc=5","date":"2026-11-12","timestamp":1794512164.0,"origin":"google_news_tick